<title>UK: British retail sales fall 0.8 percent.</title>
<headline>British retail sales fall 0.8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retail sales fell 0.8 percent in December after a 0.8 percent rise the previous month, official figures showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Analysts had expected a small rise in December sales and the news gave a boost to government bonds as it reduced the likelihood of an increase in interest rates.</p>
</text>
